      "textRaw": "NanoID",
      "name": "nanoid",
      "desc": "<p><code>nanoid</code> 模块用于生成短字符串 ID.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>源码依据: <code>runtime/api/augment/nanoid/NanoID.kt</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">nanoid</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[@] nanoid",
          "name": "[@]_nanoid",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "nanoid(size?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "nanoid",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>[ size = <code>21</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - ID 长度</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>生成指定长度的随机字符串 ID. 随机源为 <code>java.security.SecureRandom</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">console.log(nanoid()); // 默认 21 位\nconsole.log(nanoid(10)); // 10 位\n</code></pre>\n<p>当前字符表来自源码中的 <code>urlAlphabet</code> 常量, 由 64 个 URL 友好字符组成.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "size?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[@] nanoid"
        }
